+# The code parts of unit `name`, into `output`: 0 for a unit compiled whole. Without the prototype, the checker's and
+# the backend's units' BUSTER_CODEGEN_PARTITIONS. With it, by the units' sizes on the 9700X: the checker's unit PARTS,
+# the backend's two thirds, the front end's a third, the other main.c units and the benchmarks whose compile takes more
+# than about nine seconds a sixth (two at least), and the small units whole.
+function(buster_codegen_parts name output)
+    set(parts 0)
+    if(NOT buster_parallel_codegen)
